# A TEST MODEL FOR US3DA SECTION
# US3DA uses the registry whose dimensions are optimized against the
# tabulated AISC section properties, so the computed area and inertias
# match the AISC values more closely than the nominal geometry.

node 1 0 0 0
node 2 1 0 0

orientation B3DL 1 0. 1. 0.

material Elastic1D 1 10

section US3DA W44X408 1 1 10 0 0
section US3DA HSS34X10X1 2 1 10 0 0
section US3DA WT22X204 3 1 10 0 0
section US3DAC WT12X31 4 1 10

element B31 1 1 2 1 1
element B31 2 1 2 2 1
element B31 3 1 2 3 1
element B31 4 1 2 4 1

fix2 1 E 1

displacement 1 0 1 3 2

step static 1

analyze

peek node 2

# Node 2:
# Coordinate:
#   1.0000e+00  0.0000e+00  0.0000e+00
# Displacement:
#  -4.5330e-02 -6.7998e-17  1.0000e+00  0.0000e+00 -1.5000e+00 -1.0196e-16
# Resistance:
#   1.0632e-09 -1.9041e-10  9.5821e+09  0.0000e+00  2.5659e-06  8.6447e-11
